h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Key Advantages</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-8">Why Get EN 15038 Certified?</h3><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Regulatory Compliance</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Meet all regulatory requirements for translation services quality management.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-globe-europe text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Market Access</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Access markets requiring EN 15038 certification worldwide.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-award text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Quality Assurance</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Demonstrate commitment to delivering high-quality translation services consistently.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-trophy text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Competitive Advantage</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Stand out in the translation industry with recognized quality certification.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Risk Management</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Reduce translation quality risks and ensure accuracy, consistency, and client satisfaction.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 flex flex-col justify-center"><h3 class="heading-font text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Why Eurocert?</h3><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Our experienced auditors understand translation service quality requirements and can guide you through the certification process.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">25+</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Years Experience</span></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">ACCREDITED</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font"><a href="/accreditations/" class="hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">Independent Third-Party Audits</a></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Explore More</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Related Certifications</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/management-system/iso-9001/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367536/eurocert/m2.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">ISO 9001</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Quality Management</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/management-system/iso-14001/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367542/eurocert/m3.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">ISO 14001</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Environmental Management</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/management-system/iso-45001/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367547/eurocert/m4.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">ISO 45001</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">OH&amp;S Management</span></div></a></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto p-10 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Get Certified</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Quick Inquiry</h2><p class="text-white/45 mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto text-sm leading-relaxed">Our translation quality experts are ready to guide your organization through EN 15038 certification.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/contact/">Get Started <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a><a href="tel:+919316012883" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white border border-white/15 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-phone text-[9px]"></i> Call Us Now</a></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Standard Evolution</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">EN 15038 <span class="text-euro-600">vs ISO 17100</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">EN 15038:2006 was the first European quality standard written specifically for translation services. It was withdrawn and replaced by the international standard EN ISO 17100:2015, which now defines requirements for the core processes, resources and quality of every translation service provider (LSP).</p><p>Because ISO 17100 inherits and strengthens the EN 15038 framework, certification against EN 15038 is no longer available as a new certificate. Existing and prospective translation providers are certified against ISO 17100, which confirms translator and reviewer competence, a defined translation workflow, and a documented quality management system.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">What Changed</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What Replaced <span class="text-euro-600">EN 15038?</span></h2></div><p>EN ISO 17100:2015 replaced EN 15038:2006 and adds explicit requirements for translation-project management, reference materials, terminology, and corrective actions. The hallmarks of the older standard are retained: the TEP process, in which every translation is T-ranslated, E-dited, and P-roofread, and documented translator competence.</p><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-3 mt-8">Key Requirements of ISO 17100</h3><ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5"><li>Translator, reviser and reviewer competence with defined qualifications and experience</li><li>TEP workflow: translation, editing and proofreading for every assignment</li><li>Client-translator agreement and clear project specification</li><li>Documented quality management and record keeping</li><li>Use of reference materials, terminology tools and revisions</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Who Needs It</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Who Needs <span class="text-euro-600">ISO 17100 Certification?</span></h2></div><p>Translation agencies and language service providers that serve EU buyers, regulators or international clients use ISO 17100 to prove process reliability. It is relevant to general and technical translation companies, interpreting bureaus offering written translation, in-house language departments of exporters, and specialist providers of legal, technical or medical translation.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Process</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Certification <span class="text-euro-600">Process</span></h2></div><ol class="space-y-2 text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5"><li>Application and pre-assessment of your process and resources</li><li>Stage 1 audit: document review of the quality management system</li><li>Stage 2 audit: on-site verification of translation workflow, competence records and TEP controls</li><li>Certificate issued, valid for three years with annual surveillance</li></ol><p>Typical documentation includes translator CVs and competence records, project files, client agreements, training plans, process maps and quality records. Lead time is usually four to eight weeks depending on readiness, and cost depends on company size and number of sites.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">FAQ</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">EN 15038 <span class="text-euro-600">FAQ</span></h2></div><details class="seo-faq"><summary>Can I still certify against EN 15038?</summary><div class="ans">No. EN 15038:2006 has been withdrawn and replaced by EN ISO 17100:2015. New certification is issued against ISO 17100.</div></details><details class="seo-faq"><summary>Is an ISO 17100 certificate accepted where EN 15038 was required?</summary><div class="ans">Yes. Buyers that previously asked for EN 15038 now accept ISO 17100, which is the direct successor and supersedes the older standard.</div></details><details class="seo-faq"><summary>Does the standard cover interpreting?</summary><div class="ans">ISO 17100 covers translation services. Interpreting is covered by the separate standard ISO 18841.</div></details><details class="seo-faq"><summary>Does Eurocert provide consultancy for ISO 17100?</summary><div class="ans">No. To protect impartiality, Eurocert does not provide implementation consultancy for management systems it certifies.</div></details></div></div></section><style is:global>.seo-faq{border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:12px;background:#f8fafc;margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden}.seo-faq summary{cursor:pointer;padding:16px 20px;font-weight:700;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;color:#0f172a}.seo-faq summary::after{content:"+";color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:800}.seo-faq .ans{padding:0 20px 16px;color:#64748b;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7}</style>
</BaseLayout>
